---
source: crates/dreamd-cli/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: "subcommand_help(\"salience-drift\")"
---
Report the salience distribution, top clusters, and drift against the snapshot from 7 days ago.

Scores every episodic doc with salience alone (no BM25) and writes today's snapshot under `.agent/.dreamd/observability/`.

Usage: salience-drift [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --json
          Print one compact JSON report instead of the text lines

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
